Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=112}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.01,0:01:57.68,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,Ooh, that was good!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.97,0:02:01.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You pirates know some funny tricks!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.73,0:02:04.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Teach me how to do that one, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.31,0:02:06.06,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.81,0:02:09.28,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,Huh? Um... Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.36,0:02:14.15,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,Oh no! No, no, no, no, no! Ace!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.16,0:02:16.95,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,What happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.95,0:02:20.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought we were having fun,\Nbut now you're out cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.95,0:02:22.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.96,0:02:28.21,Main-207+,Franky & Usopp,0,0,0,,– Come on, man!\N– Come on, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.63,0:02:32.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh... I fell asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.97,0:02:36.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't freak me out like that, I thought\Nyou were dead! My bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.01,0:02:39.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I do that sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.76,0:02:41.89,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,I was really worried about you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.89,0:02:46.02,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,Well, whatever, If you're tired,\Nwe should call it a night.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.02,0:02:48.27,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,I mean, you look like you wanna go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.27,0:02:50.07,Main-207+,Ace,0,0,0,,What're you talking about, Yamato?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.07,0:02:52.65,Main-207+,Ace,0,0,0,,Nobody is calling it a night just yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.40,0:02:57.28,Main-207+,Ace,0,0,0,,I gotta meet up with my crew first thing\Nin the morning and it's already getting late.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.28,0:02:59.87,Main-207+,Ace,0,0,0,,It'd be a waste to go to sleep, dontcha think?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.00,0:03:05.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, but you better not fall asleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.16,0:03:07.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll give it my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.04,0:03:09.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now let me think, where were we?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.29,0:03:12.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}You were talking about your brother again, obviously!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.92,0:03:17.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ahh, that's right, {\i1}you{\i0} were talking about how\Nyou want to become Kozuki Oden!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.05,0:03:19.35,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,Close, but not quite, Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.35,0:03:22.10,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,I don't want to be him. I {\i1}will{\i0} be!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.52,0:03:24.81,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,I'll make my dream come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.81,0:03:26.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's all right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.56,0:03:28.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My map to the future!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.69,0:03:31.82,Main-207+,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,D?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.03,0:03:34.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.32,0:03:39.57,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,Funny. I never thought we'd meet,\Nbut all of a sudden you were here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.03,0:03:42.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That says "Oden."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.91,0:03:44.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That journal, was it my father's?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.46,0:03:51.50,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,It sure was. A tale of his adventures\Nacross the world, of a life well-lived.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.63,0:03:56.30,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,I found the journal on the shore\Nof the river below Oden Castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.05,0:04:00.64,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,Someone must have protected it\Nfrom burning inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.64,0:04:02.26,Main-207+,Shinobu,0,0,0,,A miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.89,0:04:05.22,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,Momonosuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.35,0:04:10.19,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,You should know. Oden wrote\Na lot about you in this book.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.23,0:04:15.11,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,It says in here that\Nyou were born on Whitebeard's ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.44,0:04:17.93,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,After that, you saw Roger's, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.41,0:04:26.70,Main-207+,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,But I was so young, I hardly rember a thing\Nfrom then. It pains me to say that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.70,0:04:29.96,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,Whitebeard, Roger, and Oden.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.96,0:04:31.29,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,They all made the same claim.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.04,0:04:34.50,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,About twenty years after their trip,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.50,0:04:39.26,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,here in the New World, strong young pirates\Nwould show up in droves.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.26,0:04:41.38,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,And here we are today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.47,0:04:49.14,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,I was sure that Ace\Nwould be at the top of that list.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.44,0:04:54.27,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,But when he died,\NI suddenly recalled something.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.11,0:04:56.57,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,Something he told me that night.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.57,0:05:00.20,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.78,0:05:04.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aw crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.16,0:05:05.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It just slipped out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.74,0:05:08.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, I wasn't gonna tell you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.45,0:05:10.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just forget I said anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.71,0:05:12.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, and you better not laugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.71,0:05:14.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sabo and I won't stand for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.00,0:05:19.51,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,{\i1}You know. I have never left this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.51,0:05:23.80,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,So even the things I know,\NI probably haven't seen with my own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.39,0:05:28.93,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,I hadn't seen the world Oden wrote about,\Nor the family Ace told me about.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.56,0:05:33.15,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,But there was something\Nin that moment we shared
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.15,0:05:35.11,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,{\i1}that was real to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.98,0:05:37.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's my brother's dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.19,0:05:39.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even to this day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.07,0:05:46.58,Main-207+,Sabo,0,0,0,,{\3c&H5C4714&\4c&H56460A&}We're gonna leave this country someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.08,0:05:50.58,Main-207+,Sabo,0,0,0,,{\3c&H5C4714&\4c&H56460A&}Set out to sea and live free.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.58,0:05:55.88,Main-207+,Sabo,0,0,0,,{\q2}{\3c&H5C4714&\4c&H56460A&}And after I've traveled the world, I'm gonna write\Na book about all of my adventures. And I won't
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.88,0:05:58.88,Main-207+,Sabo,0,0,0,,{\3c&H5C4714&\4c&H56460A&}even mind doing it, because I {\i1}love{\i0} sailing!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.88,0:06:03.09,Main-207+,Sabo,0,0,0,,{\3c&H5C4714&\4c&H56460A&}So let's become stronger,\Nbecause we're gonna be pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.30,0:06:07.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H5C4714&\4c&H56460A&}– Hm? Exactly. I've been planning\Nto be a pirate from the start!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.93,0:06:14.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}{\3c&H5C4714&\4c&H56460A&}I'll be so tough that all the other pirates and even the Marines\Nwill bow at my feet! The whole world will know my name!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.06,0:06:17.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H5C4714&\4c&H56460A&}That'll be the legacy I leave behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.36,0:06:23.15,Main-207+,Ace,0,0,0,,{\q2}{\3c&H5C4714&\4c&H56460A&}People can hate me, or they can wish that I'd never been born,\Nbut they're not gonna ignore me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.53,0:06:27.58,Main-207+,Ace,0,0,0,,{\3c&H5C4714&\4c&H56460A&}That's what it means to be strong!\NTo be a great pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.58,0:06:31.50,Main-207+,Gold Roger,0,0,0,,{\3c&H060661&\4c&H02033E&}Seems odd the Government prohibits us\Nfrom looking into it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.50,0:06:34.37,Main-207+,Gold Roger,0,0,0,,{\3c&H060661&\4c&H02033E&}There must be a vast treasure there!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.72,0:06:38.79,Main-207+,Gold Roger,0,0,0,,{\3c&H060661&\4c&H02033E&}It makes it all the more tantalizing to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.17,0:06:42.80,Main-207+,Gold Roger,0,0,0,,{\3c&H060661&\4c&H02033E&}If we find it, the world\Nwould know without a doubt
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.80,0:06:45.76,Main-207+,Gold Roger,0,0,0,,{\3c&H060661&\4c&H02033E&}that we're the greatest pirate crew of all!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.76,0:06:47.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H060661&\4c&H02033E&}Ah, yes, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.51,0:06:51.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H5C4714&\4c&H56460A&}Oh, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.22,0:06:53.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H5C4714&\4c&H56460A&}Alright then!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.39,0:06:55.06,Main-207+,Gold Roger,0,0,0,,{\3c&H060661&\4c&H02033E&}Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.06,0:06:56.73,Main-207+,Gold Roger,0,0,0,,{\3c&H060661&\4c&H02033E&}Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.90,0:07:02.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H060661&\4c&H02033E&\t(853,3063,\3cH00000&\4c&H00000&)}I'm gonna be–
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.78,0:07:09.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You dork, always trying to show me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.66,0:07:11.66,Main-207+,Whitebeard,0,0,0,,You sound like a child, Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.41,0:07:15.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, I dunno if you're gonna be a king or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.92,0:07:19.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but you're gonna do something crazy,\NI'll say that much!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.22,0:07:32.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When I heard Luffy say that, well...\NSabo and I laughed right at his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.10,0:07:35.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even so. I won't let anyone else laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.48,0:07:37.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Cause I believe in Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.10,0:07:40.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ace! I don't doubt for a second\Nthat he'll be able to pull it off. That's why–
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.73,0:07:44.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.36,0:07:46.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.49,0:07:49.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yamato, are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.87,0:07:53.70,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,I promise, I won't laugh at him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.58,0:07:58.29,Thoughts-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,Those are the exact words\Nthe King of the Pirates said!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.29,0:08:01.09,Thoughts-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,The words that moved Oden's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.09,0:08:07.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Oden spoke of a great man he met,\Nand that man said the exact same words as your brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.30,0:08:08.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It sounds like Luffy is
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.93,0:08:10.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,every bit as amazing as you claim!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.81,0:08:14.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ohh. A great man, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.43,0:08:15.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wonder what he's like.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.93,0:08:19.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I hope someday Luffy\Nand I can talk with him over a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.56,0:08:22.61,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,I'm sure you would've gotten along!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.32,0:08:24.57,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,A pity he's already dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.57,0:08:26.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, he's dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.19,0:08:30.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I guess in that case, we'll pour one out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.70,0:08:32.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.99,0:08:34.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is it this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.12,0:08:36.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you think
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.37,0:08:38.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we could share drinks instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.04,0:08:42.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not like now. I mean,\Nlike me, you, and your brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.29,0:08:45.05,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,Somewhere at sea\N{\i1}after{\i0} I can get away from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.05,0:08:46.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That sounds like a blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.67,0:08:47.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Y'really mean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.67,0:08:50.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But, one thing, the sea's not exactly small.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.68,0:08:54.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you take too long to leave here,\NI might be so far away that I'll never
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.43,0:08:55.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,get to see– Oh, don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.43,0:08:57.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I just need something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.68,0:08:59.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A fingernail clipping or a hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.48,0:09:00.77,Main-207+,Ace,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.77,0:09:03.27,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,Your choice! Whatever you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.27,0:09:04.27,Main-207+,Ace,0,0,0,,Oh, okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.40,0:09:06.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.82,0:09:12.57,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,I made this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.57,0:09:13.24,Main-207+,Ace,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.24,0:09:15.20,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,It's your Vivre Card!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.20,0:09:17.95,Main-207+,Ace,0,0,0,,Ohh. So this is it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.71,0:09:21.29,Main-207+,Ace,0,0,0,,This is just a piece of paper!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.92,0:09:27.09,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,{\q2}Yeah, and it's really special!\NBecause this paper will bring us back together someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.09,0:09:28.42,Main-207+,Ace,0,0,0,,How does that work?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.09,0:09:29.97,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,Watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.22,0:09:40.06,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,{\q2}If there's someone you want to see again, just tear off a piece\Nand give it them so they can find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.73,0:09:41.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.60,0:09:43.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks a bunch!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.25,0:10:00.66,Main-207+,Ace,0,0,0,,Yamato!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.75,0:10:05.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You better not lose that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.27,0:10:24.94,Main-207+,Usopp,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.44,0:10:34.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? What's this about?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.49,0:10:40.58,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Ace!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.95,0:10:43.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Promise you'll come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.17,0:10:53.17,Main-207+,Ace,0,0,0,,You bet I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.97,0:11:04.02,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,{\i1}That... was the last time I saw him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.07,0:11:15.86,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,My fool of a son is at it again, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.86,0:11:20.70,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,That's fine. Thanks to Red Hair's interruption,\NI have a bit of time to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.16,0:11:24.25,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,{\q2}I can deal with one little temper tantrum, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.46,0:11:31.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You promised that\Nyou would come back someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.13,0:11:39.85,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,He can cling to whatever nonsense he likes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.86,0:11:59.03,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,He'll never get off this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.03,0:12:00.74,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,I'll make sure of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.90,0:12:09.21,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,My father is too strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.21,0:12:12.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna die in this damned place!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.07,0:12:17.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I had one friend in this world and he died.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.34,0:12:21.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I couldn't save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.26,0:12:23.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I couldn't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.22,0:12:28.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll never be free.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.89,0:12:31.31,Flashbacks-207+,Ace,0,0,0,,Why are you letting him chain your heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.56,0:12:34.48,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,I'm trying, Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.48,0:12:37.78,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,I want to be free like Oden,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.78,0:12:40.07,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,but I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.41,0:12:45.79,Flashbacks-207+,Oden,0,0,0,,"Now, I can't help but look\Nto the future. In twenty years,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.79,0:12:52.00,Flashbacks-207+,Oden,0,0,0,,{\q2}strong young pirates will come\Nto the New World in droves and lead us to a new era."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.42,0:12:56.51,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,The toughest one is gonna show up\Na few years from now, and that's my brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.05,0:12:59.95,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,You'll see! He's gonna make a big wave!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.80,0:13:06.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's time to come home.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.60,0:13:09.23,Thoughts-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,Then I'll be patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.69,0:13:12.56,Thoughts-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,I'll wait for the same thing\NOden was holding out for.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.19,0:13:15.65,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,We don't want to fight. Please come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.03,0:13:18.78,Thoughts-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,I know the next era will come.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.78,0:13:20.07,Thoughts-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,I have faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.41,0:13:22.78,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,You hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.78,0:13:24.74,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,I'm waiting for you, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.74,0:13:27.75,Thoughts-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,I'll keep fighting until then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.75,0:13:31.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you don't start listening to me and soon,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.67,0:13:35.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll beat the truth into you\Nuntil you understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.50,0:13:39.54,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,If that's what you want, fine.\NI can beat {\i1}you{\i0} right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.31,0:13:48.97,Flashbacks-207+,Ace,0,0,0,,That's it, Yamato!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.97,0:13:53.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, you old bastard, I am {\i1}Kozuki Oden{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.90,0:14:02.28,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,On the day that Ace died, I still had no idea\Nwhat was happening in the outside world.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.91,0:14:05.74,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,But later, I read all about it in a newspaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.24,0:14:10.87,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,I learned that Ace was the son\Nof Gol D. Roger, the King of the Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.62,0:14:16.34,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,And just like he said he would, his brother\Nalso made a name for himself as a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.34,0:14:19.30,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,And now Luffy's here, thanks to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.17,0:14:22.55,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,Momonosuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.26,0:14:27.39,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,Here, this belongs to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.76,0:14:32.31,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,This is what Oden wrote about the future.
Comment: 0,0:14:32.31,0:14:32.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{=26}=== Oden Future Typesetting ===
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.31,0:14:32.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\clip(m 1078 896 l 1078 912 1100 926 1094 950 1114 958 1126 982 1142.22 995.88 1170.49 1045.31 1060 1054 1029.25 1004.62 1014 984 986 940 968 926 962 902 948 900 918 814 828 832 884 910 902 938 921.81 966.65 946.84 1005.62 975.08 1046.93 980 1072 310 1066.4 390.8 913.6 662 756 938 650 1297.6 896 1354.36 965.15 1349.68 977.22 1352.41 979.94 1366.42 980.72 1375.38 996.68 1375.77 1004.74 1377.57 1009.11 1380.23 1012.18 1389.98 1019.18 1394.31 1029.23 1396.53 1044.56 1400.45 1052.08 1468.81 1068.32 1617.2 1061.03 1613.41 908.48)}This is what Oden wrote about the future.
Comment: 0,0:14:32.52,0:14:35.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{=27}=== Oden Future Typesetting ===
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.02,0:14:38.98,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,"Now, I can't help but look to the future."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.95,0:14:46.32,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,"In twenty years, strong young pirates\Nwill come to the New World in
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.95,0:14:49.97,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,droves and lead us to a new era."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.37,0:14:53.29,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,"Do not fear if I die."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.58,0:15:01.33,Main-207+,Yamato,0,0,0,,"For they shall appear in my stead,\Nand defeat Kaido!"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.63,0:15:06.09,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,You want the One Piece?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.30,0:15:14.48,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,{\q2}You think you can tread upon the same path\Nas beasts such as I? That's a {\i1}dream within a dream{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.44,0:15:22.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you've had fun playing pirates.\NBut this isn't some game.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.94,0:15:26.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your lesson isn't reaching\Nthese children, Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.91,0:15:28.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let me give it a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.08,0:15:36.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.67,0:15:39.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll have our moment, Killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.25,0:15:42.88,Main-207+,Kid,0,0,0,,I've even gathered up an arsenal!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.30,0:15:49.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna bury you, you damn Emperors!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.90,0:16:05.65,Main-207+,Kid,0,0,0,,Huh? Another one?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.12,0:16:03.38,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,I had it under cont–
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.65,0:16:07.61,Main-207+,Killer,0,0,0,,That was sloppy. Are all you
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.61,0:16:09.74,Main-207+,Killer,0,0,0,,Straw Hats so fast and loose with your plans?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.74,0:16:12.62,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,I assure you, this was not my plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.62,0:16:15.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, their captain is the fast and loose one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.70,0:16:17.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where is he, by the way?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.46,0:16:24.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Worst Generation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.21,0:16:26.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They just keep slinking in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.59,0:16:30.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let them pile up, they'll scatter\Nlike dust in the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.85,0:16:38.14,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,Even if you strike\Nat this old wound, I won't feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.23,0:16:45.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sit your asses down\Nand give up, you damn rookies.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.94,0:16:48.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like the Akazaya samurai did.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.87,0:17:03.04,Flashbacks-207+,Oden,0,0,0,,Now, I can't help but look to the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.17,0:17:14.22,Flashbacks-207+,Oden,0,0,0,,{\q2}In twenty years, strong young pirates will come\Nto the New World in droves and lead us to a new era.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.85,0:17:18.23,Flashbacks-207+,Oden,0,0,0,,Do not fear if I die.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.23,0:17:18.35,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\clip(m 762 980 l 794 1000 818 1014 844 1020 880 1038 904 1038 960 1014 906 994 872 944 1132 932 1128 942 1126 950 1096 984 1164 952 1192 926 1202 918 1238 910 1252 894 1514 878 1708 1016 1584 1046 880 1072 578 1064 430 1064 404 862)}Do not fear if I die.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.35,0:17:18.43,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\clip(m 1319.38 1063.34 l 1322.71 1044.83 1338.26 1012.62 1354.92 980.4 1360.48 967.82 1354.55 951.16 1312.71 947.82 1249.39 969.3 1238.28 947.08 1211.62 954.49 1207.54 994.1 1197.18 1017.43 1186.44 1030.39 1174.22 1038.53 1184.96 1057.04 1186.07 1064.45 812.75 1074.95 801.83 1065.1 776.94 1055.99 761.6 1046.43 760.49 1040.43 769.16 1023.53 773.38 1014.2 743.37 1008.86 711.14 998.63 693.8 986.85 676.01 968.62 644 948.39 631.77 938.83 626.66 937.05 623.77 941.28 627.11 949.28 638.44 963.73 645.34 972.4 644.22 973.07 622.44 958.39 586.48 926.2 554.37 927.04 523.1 1063.1)}Do not fear if I die.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.35,0:17:25.11,Flashbacks-207+,Oden,0,0,0,,For they shall appear in my stead,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.78,0:17:28.74,Flashbacks-207+,Oden,0,0,0,,and defeat Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.36,0:17:31.36,Main-207+,Oden,0,0,0,,We don't need backup to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.36,0:17:33.62,Main-207+,Oden,0,0,0,,Why don't you sit down\Nand watch how it's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.62,0:17:34.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.12,0:17:34.83,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,What he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.49,0:17:37.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna eat you boys alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.37,0:17:42.50,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.05,0:17:43.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.43,0:18:00.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Linlin.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.68,0:18:04.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you know what this little punk said\Nto me the last time I ran into him?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.44,0:18:06.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can imagine. He's pretty cheeky!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.36,0:18:10.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And he's got quite a mouth on him!\NBut that wasn't the worst of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.94,0:18:14.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He ruined my party and destroyed my castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.57,0:18:18.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So how about an apology?\NEh, Straw Hat? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.96,0:18:24.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You got nothing to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.96,0:18:28.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,C'mon, kid, where's that bravado of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.80,0:18:33.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tell us what you're gonna be.\NI dare you. Say it to our faces!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.81,0:18:42.06,Flashbacks-207+,Kin'Emon,0,0,0,,Remember, we're counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.69,0:18:45.85,Flashbacks-207+,Kin'Emon,0,0,0,,Sir Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.36,0:18:52.32,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I am so grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.75,0:19:04.33,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,Kin'emon, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.46,0:19:07.75,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,I tried to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.79,0:19:10.34,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,Sorry I took so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.80,0:19:20.22,Main-207+,Kin'Emon,0,0,0,,I am full of regret.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.52,0:19:26.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't even die.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.02,0:19:27.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm too ashamed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.36,0:19:33.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How can I show my face\Nto Lord Oden in the afterlife?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.90,0:19:34.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kin, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.07,0:19:39.95,Main-207+,Kin'Emon,0,0,0,,Can you carry the weight for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.33,0:19:43.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Will you deliver this country?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.00,0:19:46.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.62,0:19:47.75,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.75,0:19:49.29,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,Of course I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.79,0:19:52.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Because you are my friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.18,0:20:01.43,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,You ignoring me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.68,0:20:05.39,Thoughts-207+,Kin'Emon,0,0,0,,Sir Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.39,0:20:06.69,Thoughts-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.85,0:20:09.94,Thoughts-207+,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,I thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.77,0:20:13.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Traffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.57,0:20:15.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Traffy! Move them all downstairs!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.24,0:20:23.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not again! What is happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.29,0:20:25.70,Main-207+,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.17,0:20:34.63,Flashbacks-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,You call it Haki, but in the Land\Nof Wano, it's known as "Ryuo."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.63,0:20:37.51,Flashbacks-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,The term means "flow."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.51,0:20:40.72,Flashbacks-207+,Kin'Emon,0,0,0,,Lord Oden was executed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.72,0:20:44.93,Flashbacks-207+,Kin'Emon,0,0,0,,By order of the Shogun of Wano\Nwho is in an alliance with the pirate, Kaido.
Comment: 0,0:20:44.93,0:20:44.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{=44}=== By the shogun of Wano and the pirate Kaido! ===
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.93,0:20:44.97,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\iclip(m 363.72 946.78 l 377.21 997.3 388.98 1064.43 304.2 1061.31 307.31 952.66)}By order of the Shogun of Wano\Nwho is in an alliance with the pirate, Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.97,0:20:45.02,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\iclip(m 1124.04 945.81 l 1135.81 1010.17 1149.65 1086.57 208.52 1083.02 234.71 907.72)}By order of the Shogun of Wano\Nwho is in an alliance with the pirate, Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.02,0:20:45.06,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\iclip(m 1504.45 932.91 l 1525.78 1014.61 1543.39 1085.03 200 1068.8 451.2 768)}By order of the Shogun of Wano\Nwho is in an alliance with the pirate, Kaido.
Comment: 0,0:20:45.06,0:20:45.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{=45}=== By the shogun of Wano and the pirate Kaido! ===
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.52,0:20:47.68,Flashbacks-207+,Dogstorm,0,0,0,,Sir Raizo is here, and he is well.
Comment: 0,0:20:45.06,0:20:45.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{=38}=== Sir Raizo is safe! ===
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.43,0:20:45.47,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\clip(m 838.55 907.06 l 890.28 974.07 928.22 1043.54 936.6 1099.71 601.6 1070.4 568 833.6)}Sir Raizo is here, and he is well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.47,0:20:45.52,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\clip(m 1024.15 876.66 l 1075.88 943.67 1113.82 1013.14 1122.2 1069.31 656 1076.8 753.6 803.2)}Sir Raizo is here, and he is well.
Comment: 0,0:20:45.52,0:20:45.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{=39}=== Raizo is safe! ===
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.68,0:20:49.98,Flashbacks-207+,Cat Viper,0,0,0,,Our people would never sell out a friend.
Comment: 0,0:20:49.98,0:20:49.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{=32}=== We'd never sell out our friends! ===
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.98,0:20:50.02,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\iclip(m 1299.86 956.93 l 1285.84 1090.51 1510.95 1108.47 1547.3 902.19)}Our people would never sell out a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.02,0:20:50.06,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\iclip(m 1293.72 974.45 l 1280.15 1089.2 1533.72 1108.47 1473.72 932.41)}Our people would never sell out a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.06,0:20:50.10,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\iclip(m 645.98 956.93 l 677.52 1080 1537.6 1072 1481.6 736)}Our people would never sell out a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.10,0:20:50.15,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\iclip(m 646.28 961.36 l 670.12 1078.89 1566.4 1052.8 1457.6 867.2)}Our people would never sell out a friend.
Comment: 0,0:20:50.15,0:20:50.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{=33}=== We'd never sell out our friends! ===
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.40,0:20:53.11,Flashbacks-207+,Pedro,0,0,0,,Listen! You-{\i0}gara{\i1} must keep moving forward!
Comment: 0,0:20:50.15,0:20:50.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{=30}=== Listen! You-gara must press on! ===
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.15,0:20:50.19,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\clip(m 1231.72 971.61 l 1265.71 998.21 1319.91 1040.09 1349.47 1059.8 1361.79 1080.49 1859.78 1138.8 1353.61 747.25)}{\i0}{\i1}Listen! You-{\i0}gara{\i1} must keep moving forward!
