Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.15,0:20:57.36,Flashbacks-207+,Yasuie,0,0,0,,The happy-go-lucky fool\Nfrom Ebisu Town makes his final journey!
Comment: 0,0:20:53.11,0:20:53.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{=48}=== The neighborly man of Ebisu Town is heading off to the great beyond! ===
