Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.44,0:21:00.66,Flashbacks-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,The rebellion's flame still burns bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.66,0:21:02.70,Flashbacks-207+,Kin'Emon,0,0,0,,To Onigashima!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.70,0:21:04.90,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Our moment is now!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.50,0:21:10.42,Flashbacks-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,But when Kaido killed him twenty years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.42,0:21:12.83,Flashbacks-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,everything in this country came\Nto a complete standstill.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.83,0:21:15.96,Flashbacks-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,Nobody deserves to be laughed\Nat when they die. Big deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.96,0:21:19.26,Flashbacks-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,Why's it so wrong to get help from me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.26,0:21:21.76,Flashbacks-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,Speak up for yourself! You're in charge, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.76,0:21:25.14,Flashbacks-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,Aren't you the leader of these guys?\NSay something already!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.14,0:21:31.37,Flashbacks-207+,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,I want to vanquish Emperor Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.82,0:21:38.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Now come with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.64,0:22:11.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Kaido! What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.27,0:22:14.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you let {\i1}him{\i0} knock you down!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.40,0:22:20.36,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,I am Monkey D. Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.03,0:22:23.28,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,The man who will surpass you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.24,0:22:29.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And I'm gonna be King of the Pirates!
